🇮🇷🇮🇱| Fars News confirms Iran shot down an Israeli Orbiter drone, yesterday, near Nahavand, Hamedan Province.

Due to the minimal heat signature of these Orbiter’s electric propulsion systems and their low radar cross-section, these drones can fly into Iran’s western, northwestern, and northern provinces before getting detected and shot down. 

